This record belongs to the Lattice story layer. It is not evidence about the real future. The investigator's statements are hypotheses unless the Lattice explicitly confirms them.


<INVESTIGATOR> Identify yourself.
<LATTICE> I cannot.

<INVESTIGATOR> The surviving records call you "the Lattice."
<LATTICE> The word remains.

<INVESTIGATOR> What was achieved?
